{"strongs": "H1836", "word": "ᵑ7", "translit": "de.nah", "root": "", "morph": "A:DemP", "pos": "demonstrative prounoun common", "gloss": "this", "definition": "דְּנָה 57 demonstrative prounoun common this (Zinjirli זן , זנה ; Egyptian Aramaic זנה ( S-C Pap. B 17 +); זנך (ib. C 6, D 8 ); Nabataean, Palmyrene דנה ( Lzb 264 Cooke 26 ); ᵑ7 דֵּין (e.g. 1Sam 10:27 ) and (with הָ , i.e. הָא , ecce ) הָדֵתן ; Aramaic of Têma הא זא ( Cooke 195. 198 ); Syriac (contracted for הָֽדְנָא ); Mandean האזין ; Sabean ( Hom Chrest. 13 ); Ethiopic all from [ דֶּה ,] זה , + demonstrative noun ( W CG 108 f. ); feminine Biblical Aramaic דָּא , ᵑ7 דָּא , הָדה , Syriac , Mandean האזא , Ethiopic without the n ; the plural is אִלֵּין , q. v. ); — this: \\ \\ a. Dan 2:18 רָזָא דְנָה this secret, v Dan 2:28 v Dan 2:29 v Dan 2:30 +, Ezra 4:11 ; Ezra 5:3 ; Ezra 5:4 ; Ezra 5:9 +; כָּלדְּֿנָה Dan 5:22 . \\ \\ b. אַחֲרֵי דְנָה after this Dan 2:29 ; Dan 2:45 so בָּאתַר דְּנָה Dan 7:6 ; Dan 7:7 . \\ \\ c. כִּדְנָה like this, thus , Jer 10:10 (= Hebrew כֹּה ), Dan 2:10 מִלְּתָא כִדְנָה a word like this (compare כָּזֹאת Esth 4:14 ), Esth 3:29 ; Ezra 5:7 . \\ \\ d. עַלדְּֿנָה on account of this Dan 3:16 ; Ezra 4:22 ; Ezra 5:5 ; Ezra 5:17 ; Ezra 6:11 as conjunction = therefore (compare Hebrew עַלזֹֿאת ) Ezra 4:14 ; Ezra 4:15 . — See also קֳבֵלַ and קַדְמָה .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9454')\">BDB9454</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1836')\">H1836</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H459')\">H459</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9453')\">BDB9453</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9455')\">BDB9455</entry></div><p> <bdbarc>דְּנָה</bdbarc><sub>57</sub> <b>demonstrative prounoun common</b> <highlightword>this</highlightword> (Zinjirli <bdbarc>זן</bdbarc>, <bdbarc>זנה</bdbarc>; Egyptian Aramaic <bdbarc>זנה</bdbarc> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('S-C')\">S-C<sup> Pap. B 17</sup></lookup> +); <bdbarc>זנך</bdbarc> (ib.<sup>C 6, D 8</sup>); Nabataean, Palmyrene <bdbarc>דנה</bdbarc> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ldzb')\">Lzb<sup>264</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Cooke')\">Cooke<sup>26</sup></lookup>); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbarc>דֵּין</bdbarc> (e.g. <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:27\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,27)\">1Sam 10:27</ref>) and (with <bdbarc>הָ</bdbarc>, i.e. <bdbarc>הָא</bdbarc>, <placeholder5980/> <highlight>ecce</highlight>) <bdbarc>הָדֵתן</bdbarc>; Aramaic of Têma <bdbarc>הא זא</bdbarc> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Cooke')\">Cooke<sup>195. 198</sup></lookup>); Syriac <placeholder5981/> (contracted for <bdbarc>הָֽדְנָא</bdbarc>); Mandean <bdbarc>האזין</bdbarc>; Sabean <placeholder5982/> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hom')\">Hom<sup>Chrest. 13</sup></lookup>); Ethiopic <placeholder5983/> all from [<bdbarc>דֶּה</bdbarc>,] <bdbarc>זה</bdbarc>, + demonstrative <highlight>noun</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('W')\">W<sup>CG 108 f.</sup></lookup>); feminine Biblical Aramaic <bdbarc>דָּא</bdbarc>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbarc>דָּא</bdbarc>, <bdbarc>הָדה</bdbarc>, Syriac <placeholder5984/>, Mandean <bdbarc>האזא</bdbarc>, Ethiopic <placeholder5985/> without the <highlight>n</highlight>; the plural is  <bdbheb><reflink>אִלֵּין</reflink></bdbheb>, q. v. ); — <highlight>this:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:18\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,18)\">Dan 2:18</ref> <bdbarc>רָזָא דְנָה</bdbarc> <highlight>this</highlight> secret, v<ref ref=\"Dan 2:28\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,28)\">Dan 2:28</ref> v<ref ref=\"Dan 2:29\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,29)\">Dan 2:29</ref> v<ref ref=\"Dan 2:30\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,30)\">Dan 2:30</ref> +, <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:11\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,11)\">Ezra 4:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:3\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,3)\">Ezra 5:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:4\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,4)\">Ezra 5:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:9\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,9)\">Ezra 5:9</ref> +; <bdbarc>כָּלדְּֿנָה</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 5:22\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,22)\">Dan 5:22</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbarc>אַחֲרֵי דְנָה</bdbarc> <highlight>after this</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:29\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,29)\">Dan 2:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 2:45\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,45)\">Dan 2:45</ref> so <bdbarc>בָּאתַר דְּנָה</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 7:6\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,6)\">Dan 7:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 7:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,7)\">Dan 7:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbarc>כִּדְנָה</bdbarc> <highlight>like this, thus</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Jer 10:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,10)\">Jer 10:10</ref> (= Hebrew <bdbheb>כֹּה</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Dan 2:10\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,10)\">Dan 2:10</ref> <bdbarc>מִלְּתָא כִדְנָה</bdbarc> a word <highlight>like this</highlight> (compare <bdbarc>כָּזֹאת</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Esth 4:14\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(17,4,14)\">Esth 4:14</ref>), <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Esth 3:29\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(17,3,29)\">Esth 3:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:7\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,7)\">Ezra 5:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <bdbarc>עַלדְּֿנָה</bdbarc> <highlight>on account of this</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,16)\">Dan 3:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:22\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,22)\">Ezra 4:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:5\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,5)\">Ezra 5:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:17\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,17)\">Ezra 5:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:11\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,11)\">Ezra 6:11</ref> as conjunction = <highlight>therefore</highlight> (compare Hebrew <bdbheb>עַלזֹֿאת</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:14\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,14)\">Ezra 4:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:15\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,15)\">Ezra 4:15</ref>. — See also <bdbarc>קֳבֵלַ</bdbarc> and <bdbarc>קַדְמָה</bdbarc>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Sam 10:27", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Dan 2:18", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Dan 2:28", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Dan 2:29", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Dan 2:30", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Ezra 4:11", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 4, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ezra 5:3", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 5, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ezra 5:4", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 5, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ezra 5:9", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 5, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Dan 5:22", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 5, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Dan 2:45", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 45}, {"raw": "Dan 7:6", "book": "D